Bootstrap: docker
From: condaforge/miniforge3:latest

%labels
    Author Chen Meng
    Description Team-Insight shared memory system for Claude Code (AVX-optimised build)
    Version 1.4.0

%post
    # Create mount points for external drives so --bind works on any path.
    mkdir -p /media /mnt

    # conda-forge provides pyarrow compiled for generic x86_64 (no AVX required).
    conda install -y -c conda-forge \
        python=3.11 \
        pyarrow \
        pyyaml \
        pip

    # Use pre-built PyPI wheels for lancedb/pylance.
    # These wheels are compiled with AVX2/AVX-512 and require a modern x86-64 CPU.
    pip install --no-cache-dir \
        'lancedb>=0.6' \
        'pydantic>=2.0' \
        'openai>=1.0' \
        google-genai \
        cohere \
        voyageai

    # Cleanup conda cache.
    conda clean -afy

%environment
    export PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
    export LC_ALL=C.UTF-8
    export LANG=C.UTF-8

%runscript
    python "$@"

%help
    Team-Insight SIF container for Claude Code shared memory (AVX-optimised).
    Requires a modern x86-64 CPU with AVX2 or AVX-512 support.
    Uses pre-built PyPI wheels for lancedb/pylance — fast build, latest versions.

    Usage:
      apptainer exec team-insight-avx.sif python <scripts_dir>/cli.py <subcommand> [args]

    Subcommands:
      search   - Query the LanceDB memory
      remember - Save an insight to memory
      ingest   - Embed JSON files into LanceDB
